    <https://example.org/ecmp/lingaro/asset/sulu> a ns1:DataAsset ;
        dcterms:description "SULU is Lingaro’s integrated platform for project, resource, time, financial, and employee management, supporting delivery governance and workforce operations."@en ;
        skos:note """SULU is Lingaro’s enterprise platform for managing project delivery, workforce operations, resource planning, financial governance, and employee information across the organization. It serves as a central system connecting project management, timesheets, staffing, reporting, organizational structures, employee development, and business operations into a single integrated environment.

The platform is used by employees, managers, project managers, PMO, finance teams, resource managers, and leadership to support the entire engagement lifecycle, from opportunity conversion and project setup through staffing, execution, reporting, and project closure. SULU maintains key engagement information such as project details, resource assignments, billing milestones, client and internal rates, status reports, financial data, and governance artifacts.

Core capabilities include:

Project & Engagement Management: creation and administration of projects, project governance, status reporting, billing milestones, baselines, valuations, and project closure processes.
Resource & Workforce Management: staffing, capacity planning, resource requests, organization structures, employee profiles, and team visibility.
Time Tracking & Time-Off Management: timesheet submission, approval workflows, overtime tracking, utilization monitoring, and leave management.
Financial & Delivery Governance: project costing, internal and client rates, reporting, financial controls, compliance monitoring, and engagement oversight.
People & Organizational Data: employee profiles, organizational charts, team structures, locations, skills, and workforce information.
Talent Development & Performance: skills management, Growth Track, development plans, performance goals, and leadership capability frameworks.
Operational Reporting & Automation: dashboards, automated notifications, audit trails, governance alerts, and management reporting.

In addition to operational management, SULU increasingly serves as an innovation platform within Lingaro, supporting capabilities such as AI-powered success story generation, integrations with Salesforce and other internal systems, and APIs/MCP integrations used by internal accelerators and knowledge management solutions"""@en ;
        skos:prefLabel "SULU"@en ;
        ns1:classification "Public" ;
        ns1:domain <https://example.org/ecmp/lingaro/domain/organization> .

